OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FPlenty of
OL,6,Fevening sunshine and then dry
OL,7,Fovernight with prolonged clear periods
OL,8,Fand variable cloud. Staying rather
OL,9,Fwarm in urban areas but considerably
OL,10,Fcooler in the countryside by dawn.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FStaying dry with plenty of
OL,13,Fstrong sunshine, although wispy high
OL,14,Fcloud may turn the sunshine hazier at
OL,15,Ftimes. Slightly breezier than on
OL,16,FMonday but higher temperatures and
OL,17,Fbecoming very warm.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
